  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Filter a VCF/TSV/CSV variant table with stacked column/operator/value criteria and download the matching rows, and draw SVG figures of protein domains and variant positions for each allele (heterozygous or homozygous), saved as named presets. The two tools are separate: figure values are typed in by hand, not taken from the filtered table. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
